WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Hi, friends. Gani here.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Hands resting in your lap. Shoulders soft.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Now close your eyes — or just look down low.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.000
We are going to visit a place in your mind — your cozy place.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.000
A place where you feel safe and calm. It can be real, or one you make up.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Picture your cozy place.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.000
What do you see? Colors… light… the shapes of things you love.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
What sounds live in your place?

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Soft sounds. Quiet sounds. Just listen.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.000
What does your place feel like?

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Warm sun… a soft blanket… cool grass under your feet…

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:33.000
What does the air smell like in your place?

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Breathe it in, slow and easy.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:44.000
Stay in your place, and breathe with me.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:51.000
Breathe in… two, three, four. Breathe out… two, three, four.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:56.000
Your cozy place stays with you.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:03.000
You can visit any time you need a quiet minute.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:08.000
When you are ready, open your eyes.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:12.000
Wiggle your fingers. Ready to learn.
